Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 10:57:33 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] feat(theme): paint the TUI from GROK_THEME_* host colours

Sigil can push a window palette into grok-sigil without a named
CLI theme. GROK_THEME=sigil-host plus GROK_THEME_* hex keys.

Co-authored-by: gl11tchy <gl11tchy@users.noreply.github.com>
